# Secrets — never commit. web/.env.local holds the Supabase secret key and DB
# password. Use web/.env.local.example as the template.
.env
.env.local
.env*.local

# Client analytics — real revenue, DAU and retention for Indigo's games.
# Internal private repo, so the irreplaceable parts are committed and only the
# regenerable ones are ignored:
#
#   data/raw/     COMMITTED. The untouched capture bundles. These cannot be
#                 re-created: Roblox drops performance/error data after a few
#                 months (Climb Up Mountain's is already unrecoverable), and a
#                 delisted game takes everything with it. 8MB, worth it.
#   data/verify/  COMMITTED. Ground-truth dashboard exports + the coverage and
#                 inventory measurements. The harness is useless without them.
#   data/games/   IGNORED. Fully regenerable — see HANDOFF.md, one command per
#                 bundle in data/raw/. 21MB of derived output, no need to ship.
/data/*
!/data/verify/
!/data/raw/

# Raw capture dumps at the repo root (same reason)
rbx-grab-*.json

# Node / Next
node_modules/
.next/
out/
build/
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Scratch
*.log
